  "title": "ProductsPage duplicate 401 check creates dead code block with unreachable error handling",
  "description": "R6 deep audit finding. Dimension: Wiring. Severity: P1. Source SHA: bbd487a3. Scope: R6_DEEP_AUDIT_WAVE. In handleSubmit, line 582 does `if (response.status === 401) return;` which exits the function. Then line 586 checks `if (response.status === 401)` again with a different error message ('Session expired...'), but this block is unreachable dead code. The early return on line 582 means the 401-specific UX message is never shown to the user. The user sees nothing (silent return) instead of a helpful 'Session expired' message.",
